OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused said he wanted to  
OL,4,Ajoin woman found in freezer, trial     
OL,5,Ahears                                  
OL,7,FA man accused of murdering his friend  
OL,8,Fand keeping her body in his freezer    
OL,9,Frefused medication and food after his  
OL,10,Farrest and told officers he wanted to  
OL,11,Fjoin her, a court has heard.           
OL,13,FGeorge Gordon, 65, kept the dismembered
OL,14,Fbody of Delia McInerney in a chest     
OL,15,Ffreezer, along with her five guinea    
OL,16,Fpigs, for almost three years after he  
OL,17,Fallegedly murdered her in April 2023,  
OL,18,FLiverpool Crown Court has heard.       
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
