OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused said he wanted to  
OL,4,Ajoin woman found in freezer, trial     
OL,5,Ahears                                  
OL,7,FThe jury was told officers had to halt 
OL,8,Fa police interview with Gordon on 10   
OL,9,FJanuary this year when he began to     
OL,10,Fclutch at his chest.                   
OL,12,FThe defendant, who was arrested at his 
OL,13,Fflat in St Helens two days earlier,    
OL,14,Freferred to wanting to die after the   
OL,15,Fpassing of his "partner", the court    
OL,16,Fheard.                                 
